      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在相对于棒运动的参考系$K$中，棒的长度$l$被看作是同",
        "时（按这个系统的钟）记录下来的棒的两端间的距离. 这样，根",
        "据相对论，得出以下公式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$l=l_0\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}$　（8.2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为　$\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}<1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以，运动的棒的长度小于静止的棒的长度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "距离的相对性（在目前分析的这个情况下，此距离为棒两",
        "端的距离）直接与在一切惯性参考系中的光速的恒定性及时",
        "间间隔的相对性有关."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
